  "title": "UFP Industries Announces Third Quarter 2025 Results",
  "summary": "GRAND RAPIDS, Mich.–(BUSINESS WIRE)–Oct. 29, 2025– UFP Industries, Inc. (Nasdaq: UFPI) a leading manufacturer focused on delivering value-added products across its Retail, Packaging, and Construction segments reported results for the third quarter 2025. Will Schwartz, President and CEO of UFP Industries commented, “Our third quarter played out largely as anticipated and reflective of the competitive environment we are seeing […]",
